From 5ed6549845a8712369f93d9f3f75a462a6431d70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 21:36:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] classes: operator dispatch + bare method resolution (citadel
 r2, patch 32)

- operators: every perform ladder gains the instance arm (C14, left-operand
  only): + - * / % == != < <= > >=, unary -, [] and []= subscripts, and the
  instance operator () through OP_CALL. privacy rides the calling frame.
- the class-resident operator cache: one entry pointer per (class, operator),
  filled on first dispatch, sound forever under the frozen-table seal. no
  per-site MIC needed - one slot per class beats per-instruction state.
- canonical operator spellings: 'operator +', 'operator ()', 'operator []=',
  'operator Target' synthesized by one shared parser helper; whitespace
  normalized ('fu operator+(o)' == 'fu operator + (o)'). non-dispatchable
  forms ('!', '!=', compound, bitwise) refused with reasons at parse.
- operator member syntax: a.operator +(b) reaches the same entry; binds like
  any method (let m = a.operator +). 'operator' reserved as a field name.
- R1 accepted: methods participate in bare-name resolution, implicitly bound
  to this. the freeze pass bakes the ladder field -> method -> global
  (OP_GET_METHOD binds this; the store bakes the not-assignable trap).
  statics mirror it at runtime: static field -> static method -> global.
- bug: a class declared inside a method hard-errored at the ENCLOSING class's
  freeze (the walk descended into the inner class's member protos). protos
  now carry is_class_member; the walk stops at member boundaries.
- bug: bare sibling static method calls and bare glob access from static
  contexts were unreachable (the statics lane had no method/global fallback).
- one name one owner, within a body too: OP_DEFINE_METHOD refuses a same-name
  redefinition (load-bearing for the unary/binary minus split).
- dispatch_operator_method: the nested run_until lane (construction/defer
  machinery), staging above every live register; dispatch cases refresh
  exe/reg/frame after it (REFRESH_AFTER_NESTED).
- gates: e2e 379x4 (364 + 15), unit x3, embed x3.
